# Copy this file to .env.local for local development.
# .env.local is git-ignored and must never be committed.

# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# BACKEND (server-side only) — NEVER reaches the browser
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# Required for receipt OCR.  Get your key at https://platform.openai.com/api-keys
#
# Production / Preview:
#   Vercel Dashboard → your project → Settings → Environment Variables
#   Name:  OPENAI_API_KEY
#   Value: sk-...
#   Scope: ✅ Production  ✅ Preview  (leave Development unchecked)
#
# Local dev with `vercel dev`:
#   Add the line below to .env.local, then run `vercel dev` (not npm run dev).
#   The /api/ocr Edge Function runs locally and picks up the key automatically.
#
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...

# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# SECURITY NOTES
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#
# ✅  OPENAI_API_KEY — server-side only, safe to add to Vercel Dashboard
# ❌  Never create a VITE_OPENAI_API_KEY variable — VITE_* vars are bundled
#     into the browser JS bundle and expose your key publicly
